<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9183] Proper handling UUID columns, that are added by DDL.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9183</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, if we added new UUID columnt thru DDL, it is saved to schema as byte[]. So it&apos;s impossible to use it with DML without placeholders and put values thru cache api without converting UUID to byte[].&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13176710">IGNITE-9183</key>
